<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/ObservableProperty> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Alcohol By Volume"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Alcohol By Volume"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The amount of pure ethanol in 100mL of a solution."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "La quantit\u00E9 d'\u00E9thanol pur dans 100mL d'une solution."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abv> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#datatypeProperty> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Alcohol By Volume"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Alcohol By Volume"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The amount of pure ethanol in 100mL of a solution."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "La quantit\u00E9 d'\u00E9thanol pur dans 100mL d'une solution."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Alcohol by volume is a standard observable property in alcoholic beverages. It is the measurement of pure ethanol in 100 ml of a solution at a temperature of 20\u02DAC (68\u02DAF).\n         \n         The (unmaintained) bevon ontology previously maintained a property (http://rdfs.co/bevon/latest/html#term-abv) for this."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#abvValue> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#objectProperty> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brewed By"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brass\u00E9 Par"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The brewery that is marketing or physically brewing the beer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "La brasserie qui commercialise ou qui physiquement brasse la bi\u00E8re. "@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This is likely the least defined property within this ontology. While ontologically flexible to a number of different vocabulary, it is meant as a catch-all for situations where a common sense relationship is known to exist while not being immediatly obvious."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cette propri\u00E9t\u00E9 est probablement la moins d\u00E9finie dans cette ontologie. Bien que flexible ontologiquement avec une equivalence \u00E0 plusieurs cas et vocabulaires, elle est con\u00E7u comme un fourre-tout pour les situations o\u00F9 une relation \"bon sens\" exister sans \u00EAtre imm\u00E9diatement \u00E9vidente."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#brewedBy> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
