<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Milling"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fraisage"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The process by which malts are converted to grist. To increase the surface area of the malts, they are milled and then hot water is applied so that the starch can be extracted.\n        \n        The grist cannot be too coarse or else the some of the starches will not be released. Nor can the grist be too fine or a paste will form and water will not be able to drain properly."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Le processus par lequel les malts sont convertis en grist. Pour augmenter la surface des malts, ils sont broy\u00E9s puis de l'eau chaude est appliqu\u00E9e afin que l'amidon puisse \u00EAtre extrait.\n        \n        Le grain ne peut pas \u00EAtre trop grossier, sinon certains des amidons ne seront pas lib\u00E9r\u00E9s. Le grain ne peut pas non plus \u00EAtre trop fin ou une p\u00E2te se formera et l'eau ne pourra pas s'\u00E9goutter correctement."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMillingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Mashing"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "\u00C9crasement"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Similar to producing tea from tea leaves, wort is produced by allowing the the grist to steep. It is at this stage the the enzymes, mainly alpha and beta amylase, in the malt are activated.\n        \n        It is at this stage that the enzymes convert starch into sugar, which can be then be consumed by yeast during the fermentation process."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Semblable \u00E0 la production de th\u00E9 \u00E0 partir de feuilles de th\u00E9, le mo\u00FBt est produit en laissant le grist infuser. C'est \u00E0 ce stade que les enzymes, principalement alpha et b\u00EAta amylase, du malt sont activ\u00E9es.\n    \n        C'est \u00E0 ce stade que les enzymes transforment l'amidon en sucre, qui peut ensuite \u00EAtre consomm\u00E9 par la levure pendant le processus de fermentation."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerMashingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Boiling"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bouillir"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "After the wort has been extracted from the malt, it is necessary to boil the wort before fermation. Boiling does a number of things to the malt such as: sterilization, enzyme denaturing, color development, increasing the concentration, secondary products are distilled and oxidized and finally hop aromas are extracted and isomerized."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une fois le mo\u00FBt extrait du malt, il est n\u00E9cessaire de faire bouillir le mo\u00FBt avant la fermentation. L'\u00E9bullition fait un certain nombre de choses au malt telles que: la st\u00E9rilisation, la d\u00E9naturation enzymatique, le d\u00E9veloppement de la couleur, l'augmentation de la concentration, les produits secondaires sont distill\u00E9s et oxyd\u00E9s et enfin les ar\u00F4mes de houblon sont extraits et isom\u00E9ris\u00E9s."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerBoilingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fermentation"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Fermentation"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "After boiling, the beer undergoes fermentation. A process by which yeasts anaerobically convert the sugars from the malts into ethanol."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Apr\u00E8s \u00E9bullition, la bi\u00E8re subit une fermentation. Un processus par lequel les levures convertissent de mani\u00E8re ana\u00E9robie les sucres des malts en \u00E9thanol."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerFermentationActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Racking"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Soutirage"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Beer racking is the careful transferral of the beer from one vessel to another, this must be done carefully in order to minimize the disturbance of the beer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Le soutirage de la bi\u00E8re est le transfert soigneux de la bi\u00E8re d'un r\u00E9cipient \u00E0 un autre, cela doit \u00EAtre fait avec soin afin de minimiser la perturbation de la bi\u00E8re."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerRackingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conditioning"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conditionnement"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Beer is conditioned to the finaly beer product by being allowed to age in vessel, usually a wooden cask, for a certain amount of time for any unwanted byproducts to be absorbed and for the aroma to mature."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "La bi\u00E8re est conditionn\u00E9e au produit final de la bi\u00E8re en \u00E9tant laiss\u00E9e vieillir dans un r\u00E9cipient, g\u00E9n\u00E9ralement un tonneau en bois, pendant un certain temps pour que tous les sous-produits ind\u00E9sirables soient absorb\u00E9s et que l'ar\u00F4me m\u00FBrisse."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BeerConditioningActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Packaging"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Emballage"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The process by which the finished beer is transferred into a container with specific labelling so that it can now be sold as a product."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Le processus par lequel la bi\u00E8re finie est transf\u00E9r\u00E9e dans un conteneur avec un \u00E9tiquetage sp\u00E9cifique afin qu'elle puisse maintenant \u00EAtre vendue en tant que produit."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#PackagingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#TemporalEntity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Shipping"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Exp\u00E9dition"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Once the beer has been packaged, it can then be shipped to another location to be sold."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une fois la bi\u00E8re emball\u00E9e, elle peut \u00EAtre exp\u00E9di\u00E9e vers un autre endroit pour \u00EAtre vendue."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#MasterBrewersAssociationoftheAmericas1999> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ShippingActivity> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brewery"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brasserie"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A brewery is a location or corporate entity that produces beer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une brasserie est une entreprise ou un lieu qui produit de la bi\u00E8re."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Brewery> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Craft Brewery"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brasserie Artisanale"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "As defined by the Brewers Association, a craft brewery is a small, independent brewer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une brasserie est une entreprise ou un lieu qui produit de la bi\u00E8re."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Craftbrewery> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BrewersAssociation2020> .
