<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#CraftBrewery> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Regional Brewery"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brasserie r\u00E9gionale"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A regional brewery is a brewery that produces around 15,000 to 6 million barrels of beer per year."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une brasserie r\u00E9gionale est une brasserie qui produit environ 15 000 \u00E0 6 millions de barils de bi\u00E8re par an."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BrewersAssociation2020> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#RegionalBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
