<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#CraftBrewery> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Contract Brewery"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Brasserie sous Contrat"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A brewery that has a contract with a company that handles the marketing and sales part of the business while the producer-brewery only focuses on brewing beer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une brasserie qui a un contrat avec une entreprise qui g\u00E8re la partie marketing et ventes de l'entreprise, tandis que la brasserie-producteur se concentre uniquement sur le brassage de la bi\u00E8re."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BrewersAssociation2020> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#ContractBrewery> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
