<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentClass> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00001260> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://schema.org/ProductGroup> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Beer"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bi\u00E8re"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Beer a drink that is created as a result of the fermentation of yeast malt and is flavored with hops. The fermentation process results in alcohol, however there are some beers that are specifically brewed to be non-alcoholic."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "La bi\u00E8re est une boisson cr\u00E9\u00E9e \u00E0 la suite de la fermentation du malt de levure et aromatis\u00E9e au houblon. Le processus de fermentation donne de l'alcool, mais certaines bi\u00E8res sont sp\u00E9cifiquement brass\u00E9es pour \u00EAtre non alcoolis\u00E9es."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Beer> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "German Purity Law Beer"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bi\u00E8re Puret\u00E9 Allemande"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A beer that meets the requirements of the German Beer Purity Law of 1516 where beer was made exclusively from water, barley, hops and yeast."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Une bi\u00E8re qui r\u00E9pond aux exigences de la loi allemande sur la puret\u00E9 de la bi\u00E8re de 1516, o\u00F9 la bi\u00E8re \u00E9tait fabriqu\u00E9e exclusivement \u00E0 partir d'eau, d'orge, de houblon et de levure."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#GermanPurityLawBeer> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
