<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BelgianAle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Belgian Ales are ales are that are brewed in the Belgian style."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#BelgianAle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Les bi\u00E8res belges sont des bi\u00E8res brass\u00E9es dans le style belge."@fr .
