<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "English Style Ale" .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "British Style Ale"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "English Style Ale"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Style Anglais"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "English Style Ales are ales are that are brewed in the English style."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#EnglishStyleAle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Les ales \u00E0 l'anglaise sont des ales brass\u00E9es dans le style Anglais."@fr .
