<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Conteneur de Liquide"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A container made for holding liquids."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Un r\u00E9cipient con\u00E7u pour contenir des liquides."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> <http://rdfs.org/ns/void#inDataset> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#datasetdefinition> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03490100> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://rdf.ag/o/beer#LiquidContainer> .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Keg"@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F\u00FBt"@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A small barrel used to store and serve beer."@en .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Un contenant r\u00E9utilisable pour entreposer et servir la bi\u00E8re."@fr .
<https://rdf.ag/o/beer#Keg> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdf.ag/o/beer-2021-03-24> .
